I come out of the supermarket.
There is a vegetable cart on the street.
It is very crowded there.
I go near the cart.
I tell the vegetable vendor.
"Dada, I want one kilo of tomatoes."
"And I want some spinach too."
Dada gives me a small basket.
I look at the tomatoes.
They are very red and fresh.
I really like red tomatoes.
I pick the good tomatoes myself.
I put them in the basket.
Then I take fresh green spinach.
I give the basket to dada.
He weighs the vegetables.
I really like these fresh vegetables.
